flowchart TD
  p0[Phase 0<br/>state preflight] --> p1[Phase 1<br/>resolve scope]
  p0 -. stuck line .-> note2[recover stuck]
  p0 -. waiting line .-> note3[settle questions]
  p0 -. loose line .-> note7[epic triage table: one approval, epic-move each]
  p0 -. rank line .-> note4[rank unset ids]
  p0 -. leftovers line .-> note5[state lanes-recover: park, queue lanes, drain the merge queue;<br/>then state reconcile for legacy branches]
  note5 -- conflict, exit 3 --> leafM[[Merge leaf]]
  p0 -. queued lane .-> lq
  p0 -. candidate line .-> note6[state stash-triage: factfind per candidate, stash-claim]
  p1 --> p2[Phase 2<br/>print order, no question]
  p2 --> p3[Phase 3<br/>steps-init, then lanes-init]
  p3 --> p35[Phase 3.5<br/>settle open decisions, one grilling]
  p35 --> fill{{state lane-next}}
  fill -- start --> pick{{state task-next with lane, per running lane}}
  fill -- judge --> judge[[Judge leaf: backlog overlap evidence,<br/>PARALLEL yes or no, sonnet]]
  judge --> lj[state lane-judge<br/>telemetry with evidence]
  lj -- every yes: lane-next with cleared --> fill
  lj -- a no: next candidate, none cleared --> pick
  fill -- exit 1 --> pick
  pick -. lanes mode: state lane-sync before each lane task .-> leafE
  pick -- lane has no task --> lq[state lane-queue, then lane-merge<br/>first queued lane, git merge --no-ff]
  lq -- conflict --> sync[radin-sync leaf merges the base into the lane]
  sync --> lq
  lq -- merged --> lg[state lane-gate<br/>full suite on main, two fix attempts]
  lg -- green --> ld[state lane-done]
  lg -- red: fix entry at priority 21 --> ld
  ld -. hotfix lane takes the first slot and the queue head .-> fill
  pick -- round claimed nothing, no lane moved, lane-next exit 1 --> p45[Phase 4.5<br/>session gate: tests, lint, format, review]
  p45 -- findings filed, once --> fill
  pick -- exit 0 --> kind{kind}
  kind -- planning --> leafP[[Planning leaf, in its lane]]
  kind -- execution --> leafE[[Execution leaf]]
  leafE -- STATUS line --> report[task-report]
  leafE -. idle, no STATUS .-> nudge[claude: ListAgents, one nudge]
  hb([claude: per-task cron heartbeat, 20 min]) -. fires .-> nudge
  nudge --> report
  leafP -- STATUS line --> report
  leafE -. agents: leaf returns, no STATUS .-> report
  leafP -. agents: leaf returns, no STATUS .-> report
  report -- commit on a lane branch --> blocked[done after the lane merge]
  report -- commit leaves its plan paths --> route
  report --> route{next}
  route -- continue, next round --> fill
  route -- debug --> debug[[Debug leaf, once]]
  debug --> fill
  route -- clarify FACT --> ff[[Fact-finder or research]]
  ff --> fill
  route -- clarify DECISION --> park[park: blocked + Open decision line<br/>other tasks and lanes go on]
  park --> fill
  route -- irreversible work --> user[/Ask the user now/]
  user --> fill
  p45 --> p47[Phase 4.7<br/>state lanes-show]
  p47 --> p5[Phase 5<br/>state report]
  p5 -. waiting and parked entries left .-> ask5[one question per decision<br/>answer settles, or block the task]
  p5 --> p6[Phase 6<br/>point to /radin-review]
